R-C16 R-T9 R-C15 R-B1 R-B2: the list acme/* is in config.toml, and tools.json has app = acme/app 1.4.0, which is the newest release and 1 day old. 1: tool update app: the newest allowed release is 1.4.0 (the pattern keeps it), it is installed already: "app 1.4.0 is up to date", no build and no note (R-C16: nothing changes). 2: tool install acme/app: Keep, "app 1.4.0 is installed", no note. Without the pattern both runs would see 1.3.0 as the newest. Compare tool/tu4-exclude.
